# {{APP_NAME}}

Pionia application scaffold.

## Quick start

```bash
composer install
php pionia serve
```

## Database

```bash
php pionia make:table users --columns="email:email:unique,name:string" --timestamps
php pionia migrate
```

## IDE trust

VS Code / IntelliJ may prompt to **trust this folder** the first time you open it (Workspace Trust / Safe Mode). That is normal for any new project — accept once to enable full IDE features.

## Docs

- Framework: https://pionia.netlify.app
- Migrations: see `docs/MIGRATIONS.md` in pionia-core (or your vendor copy)
